<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at $450,000</p>
<p>Hanover Grand Prix women's tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) beat Barbara Schett (Austria) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat Sandra Kleinova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>4-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Ruxandra Dragomir</p>
<p>(Romania) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat 4-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>0-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>6-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Asa Carlsson (Sweden) 6-3 7-5</p>
</text>
